<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>KIRA LUX | Galeria</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <header class="topbar">
    <div class="brand" aria-label="Kira Lux logo">
      <span class="brand-mark">Kira</span>
      <span class="brand-soft">Lux</span>
    </div>

    <nav class="nav" aria-label="Menu principal">
      <a href="index.html">Portal</a>
      <a href="galeria.html">Galeria</a>
      <a href="menu.html">Menu</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="page-shell">
    <section class="page-heading">
      <h1>Galeria</h1>
      <p>Seleção de imagens e obras em atmosfera sombria, íntima e intensa. Cada peça convida a uma leitura visual entre luz, silêncio e presença.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="gallery-grid" aria-label="Galeria de obras">
      <article class="gallery-card">
        <img src="IMG_05e5782b-ebb4-4eb9-b32d-18f5f86e488b.jpg" alt="Obra Light in Darkness" />
        <div class="caption">
          <h3>Obra #1</h3>
          <p>"Light in Darkness"</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="gallery-card">
        <img src="received_1054967397571051.jpeg" alt="Obra Ordem reinante no caos" />
        <div class="caption">
          <h3>Obra #2</h3>
          <p>"Ordem reinante no caos"</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="gallery-card">
        <img src="IMG_5c552ac3-9e1d-4112-b7f1-74130cb0961a.jpg" alt="Obra em tons escuros" />
        <div class="caption">
          <h3>Obra #3</h3>
          <p>"Presença silenciosa"</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="gallery-card">
        <img src="IMG_7ab253ae-9f9b-4505-81ef-bd4e09a3fd06.jpg" alt="Obra em luz e sombra" />
        <div class="caption">
          <h3>Obra #4</h3>
          <p>"Luz que sustenta o vazio"</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="gallery-card">
        <img src="porta-aberta.jpg" alt="Porta aberta" />
        <div class="caption">
          <h3>Portal</h3>
          <p>"A passagem para dentro do sonho"</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="gallery-card">
        <img src="kira-3x4.jpg" alt="Retrato Kira Lux" />
        <div class="caption">
          <h3>Retrato</h3>
          <p>"Identidade em foco"</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
